{"baseRefOid":"c761a49c55d125bca48ff38d81b0a9ff6fd5adcf","body":"Existing saved-chart summaries cannot preserve requested houses or complete calculation receipts. Add an optional immutable receipt store with validated SDK JSON, owner-scoped records and a transactional 40-record limit. Native revocation aborts active writes and settles queued opens; failures distinguish missing, corrupt, unsupported, quota, stale and possibly committed results.\n\nStacked on #425 (`codex/platform-portable-calculation`, base `c761a49c`). Product implementation is four new profile files. The store opens only when explicitly invoked and uses its own database. Existing UI, v1 saves, accounts, ownership SDK and Astrofolio work are preserved. No active storage or account migration is enabled.\n\nValidation:\n- 4,787 tests / 411 files; production build; type check with zero errors/warnings; exact-base scope guard.\n- 74 focused tests and 22 independent actual-Chrome cases, including concurrent cap enforcement, actual abort/commit timing, pending-open cancellation, owner partition, future/corrupt records and controlled quota rollback.\n- All 18 fresh acceptance PNGs are byte-identical to the base. The first full run rejected a stale capture fingerprint; raw failure is retained, followed by original build/capture refresh and a clean full rerun. No guard or baseline was changed.\n\nSee `docs/platform/STATUS.md` and `docs/platform/evidence/saved-records/` for exact frozen identities, raw failures, commands and independent review. Application authority callbacks are not authentication. Export contains sensitive birth details; local owner/record metadata is excluded. A clear consumes its own handle, but another same-owner handle may write afterward: this is not durable account deletion. Verified access leases, inventory, guest/account handoff, export and deletion/retry must precede activation.\n\nThis is a tested draft implementation, not a publication, production deployment, completed account lifecycle or external adoption. SDK #5's explicit hold remains; the separate Astrofolio verification release does not depend on clearing it. All14 jobs pass in exact-source CI run34190846700 at `a0bf5517`. Its exact READY preview `dpl_bhx76pgozg4Djw3mbBayzay7VrxS` passes13 browser/API checks at https://zodiacs-9wi4nsxk8-zodiacsofficial.vercel.app.\n\nRollback: remove the optional files and restore the preceding acceptance fingerprint. Since no active application path opens the new database, this slice performs no user-data migration; any future activated-data cleanup requires its own verified plan.\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-09-08T05:29:15Z","authors":[{"email":"diasmal917@gmail.com","id":"U_kgDOD78UBg","login":"diasmal917","name":"diasmal917"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-08T05:29:15Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Add optional immutable saved natal records with transaction guards","oid":"a0bf55176dd4df4d27763bfeb2cf97e36abe4d15"},{"authoredDate":"2026-09-08T06:32:13Z","authors":[{"email":"diasmal917@gmail.com","id":"U_kgDOD78UBg","login":"diasmal917","name":"diasmal917"}],"committedDate":"2026-09-08T06:32:13Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"Record saved-record preview and exact-source CI acceptance","oid":"46b36e2c887405efc70762297e1087f6d14195f9"}],"files":[{"path":"docs/acceptance/phase1/screenshots/manifest.json","additions":4,"deletions":4},{"path":"docs/platform/EVIDENCE.md","additions":125,"deletions":0},{"path":"docs/platform/PLAN.md","additions":18,"deletions":1},{"path":"docs/platform/REVIEW.md","additions":12,"deletions":2},{"path":"docs/platform/STATUS.md","additions":34,"deletions":6},{"path":"docs/platform/evidence/portable-calculation/release/ci-34187725308-final.json","additions":1,"deletions":0},{"path":"docs/platform/evidence/saved-records/implementation/EVIDENCE.md.log","additions":114,"deletions":0},{"path":"docs/platform/evidence/saved-records/implementation/IMPLEMENTATION-CHOICES.md.log","additions":49,"deletions":0},{"path":"do